  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_1135.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La tarde de este mi&eacute;rcoles habr&aacute; vaquillas de Miguel Parejo en las fiestas de las calles Vila-real y adyacentes de Onda. Por la noche otra embolada de un toro del Mas de Pere, igual que la noche e este martes, uando porla tarde han corrido las vquillas y&nbsp; un toro de Juan Faet, de Almenara.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatcarrervila-real200514/img_1119.jpg\" alt=\"img_1119\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatcarrervila-real200514/img_1120.jpg\" alt=\"img_1120\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatcarrervila-real200514/img_1121.jpg\" alt=\"img_1121\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatcarrervila-real200514/img_1122.jpg\" alt=\"img_1122\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatcarrervila-real200514/img_1123.jpg\" alt=\"img_1123\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatcarrervila-real200514/img_1124.jpg\" alt=\"img_1124\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatcarrervila-real200514/img_1125.jpg\" alt=\"img_1125\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatcarrervila-real200514/img_1126.jpg\" alt=\"img_1126\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatcarrervila-real200514/img_1